TRAFFIC. If your[ website] is translated[ into many] languages, it[ will] have an[ increased] flow of traffic. If you know how to put this traffic to work, then you will probably use ads more efficiently and will receive more CTR from search engines and will increase the overall dollar amount per day. More traffic means more clicks. Similarly, more clicks mean more revenue.
