I think the tone and esthetic quality of the type and symbols is very appropriate.[ It] reminds me of[ the] animated videos—which were keyed to Gershwin’[s] Rhaps[ody] in Blue—that they would play preflight in[ United Airlines] airplanes. I think that[ same] grand[,] busy,[ and connected] world tone is resonating here.
