=== Text #2 ===
> For the month of April only: Receive Dermapen 4 Face & Neck Treatment + An Alginate Mask + IonZyme Machine Treatment for only R1,500 (all inclusive).
We are proud to launch[ the new] Derm[apen] 4 at Natural Aesthetics. We were the first clinic in South Africa[ to] receive[ the] Derm[apen] 4. So what makes the Derm[apen 4] so much better than the Derm[apen] 3 or any other microneedling device?
Derm[ap]en 4 has a 16 needle cartridge instead of just 12 needles, reaching an inflammatory response at a much quicker rate.
The Derm[ap]en 4 generates 47.9% more micro-channels than Derm[ap]en 3 and 104% more micro-channels than any counterfeit device.
The Derm[ap]en 4 generates 1,920 puncture channels per second, which means we can almost double the amount of serums and actives that we needle into the skin per treatment, than before.
The additional 620 micro-channels makes the treatment much quicker and[ more] comfortable than before.
Derm[ap]en 4 is[ the] only microneedling[ device] with a dedicated scar setting and[ protocols] for revision of deep, atrophic scars; including surgical, burn contracture, stri[ae] and post-acne scars. Needle penetration can now be increased[ up] to 3.0mm.
AOVN technology, automatically calibrates the motor speed, pressure and penetration for targeted precision.
The Derm[ap]en 4 is safer than other microneedling devices, no dragging or pulling of the skin.
Only Derm[apen 4] features a unique, medical-grade silicone seal and fluid guard. The external cartridge is fortified with a specialised fluid guard that prevents cross contamination to the outer cartridge shell. Safety First!
