More than anywhere else in the world, Europe shows that this step is[ possible]. Europe teaches the modern world that the political evolution of[ states] and state[ systems] is by no means at an end. National realpolit[ik] is[ becoming] unreal,[ not only] in Europe, but throughout the world.[ It] is[ turning into a] lose-lose game.
Europeanisation means[ creating] a[ new politics].[ It] means[ entering] as a player[ into] the[ meta-]power game,[ into] the[ struggle] to[ form] the rules[ of a] global[ order]. The catchphrase for the future might[ be:] move over America, Europe is back.
